From 5a1c0f3d7e2b4c8a9d6e1f0b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LiinkPK <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Ad hoc sockets: include arpa/inet.h for inet_pton on Android

The NDK's netinet/in.h does not declare inet_pton, which the UPnP and SOAP
port mapping code uses; the Android build failed in portmap_upnp.cpp.
---
 host/adhoc/sockets.hpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/host/adhoc/sockets.hpp b/host/adhoc/sockets.hpp
--- a/host/adhoc/sockets.hpp
+++ b/host/adhoc/sockets.hpp
@@ -15,3 +15,4 @@
 #else
+#include <arpa/inet.h>
 #include <cerrno>
 #include <fcntl.h>
--
2.43.0

